erry Blossoms in the whole region!"oScientists say that the area does not have a unique climate, and they are puzzled to why they are present."YIt's quite a shame we don't know the truth about them, but I'm sure one day we will!"HAUNTER: Haw! Haw!"(The TV is on some boring channel..."ROGGENROLA: Rogg..."Roggenrola looks worried."ROGGENROLA: Rogg!"*Roggenrola is ready to rogg and roll!"-Roggenrola was surprised by the thicket!"nKETA: I don't particularly fancy the design in here, but people have different tastes in decor I suppose."3KETA: Aelita should've never followed me here."8However, I'm a fool if I thought that she wouldn't."0I know her better than she knows herself...">KETA: Your journey has taken quite the detour, hasn't it?"NMany trainers would be jealous of this adventure. Foolhardy. All of them."$They don't know what they want."AMOM: Reunited once again! With our power no one can stop us!"FMOM: We'll make it through. Then we can be a family once again..."EMOM: You've become a great trainer. I couldn't be more proud...!"RFLORIN: Watch your step. There are a lot of rocks sticking out of the ground."2FLORIN: Bladestar will be nothing eventually."'GDC will be safe once and for all."?FLORIN: Grass types sure do make quick work of this place."FFLORIN: I wonder how much longer we have until we reach the exit?"FLORA: Don't trip."7FLORA: This is all such a bother. Don't you agree?"]FLORA: After all this we're going to have to report everything we've found to Cassandra."-Get ready for a 4 hour meeting with her."BFLORA: Why are we talking and not working to get out of here?")ERIN: Bladestar isn't a real threat."'They're just an annoying obstacle."?ERIN: You battle better than Aelita. That's for damn sure."=Maybe you should give her some lessons when we find her."1ERIN: Where did these people even come from?"2Perhaps there's a shortcut available to them."^ERIN: I tend to use more minimalistic Pokemon. What kind of Pokemon do you prefer to use?"OSHAWOTT: Oshaaa!!