his part of the region?"/LAVENDER: Roses are red, Violets are blue."Is this a joke to you?"1LAVENDER: I can feel their presence ahead...")MELIA: It's incredibly cold in here."CMaybe there's a source of water that's cooling down this cave?"EMELIA: At least we're not being chased down by mediocre lackeys."&I could totally get used to this."MMELIA: I'm tired of always being so busy. I just want a break, you know?"&AELITA: Why is this happening...?">AELITA: C'mon \PN, we have to destroy their power source!"DAELITA: Sensei was working for Team Xen...? I won't believe it!".There's a breaking news story going on..."PHello everyone, and welcome to the West Gearen News! I am your host Volta~."JToday we have an exclusive interview with the Steel Gym Leader, Saki!"KSo, Saki, what are your thoughts on the current S.S. Oceana situation?"@"SAKI: HeeHee, what an odd question to ask a gal like moi~""Q"But if you really had to know; I think the ship was manufactured terribly.""Y"See if they bought parts from Saki's Steel Industry; they would be set for life...""h"So come on down everyone! Come to Saki's Steel Industry, and I'll give you everything half price!"""This concludes our interview."EToday we investigate the whereabouts of the missing S.S. Oceana!"OThe S.S. Oceana was supposed to dock at Oceana Pier at 4:30 on August 5th!"HHowever, it seems as though the ship has disappeared into thin air!"kOur sources say that a mysterious organization had something to do with the disappearance of the ship!"&This concludes our investigation."<Today we investigate the mysterious Crystalcharge cave!"hCrystalcharge cave is known for its high electrical properties. However, why is this the way it is?"eWe've had many trainers try and find out the true cause of it's properties, but all have failed."QMaybe one day we can can finally learn the truth about that mysterious cave!"DToday we investigate the beautiful Cherry Blossoms of Route 2~!"HRoute 2 holds the only spot of Cherry Blossoms in the whole region!"oScientists say that the area does not have a unique climate, and they are puzzled to why they are present."YIt's quite a shame we don't know the truth about them, but I'm sure one day we will!"HAUNTER: Haw! Haw!"(The TV is on some boring channel..."ROGGENROLA: Rogg..."Roggenrola looks worried."ROGGENROLA: Rogg!"*Roggenrola is ready to rogg and roll!"-Roggenrola was surprised by the thicket!"nKETA: I don't particularly fancy the design in here, but people have different tastes in decor I suppose."3KETA: Aelita should've never followed me here."8However, I'm a fool if I thought that she wouldn't."0I know her better than she knows herself...">KETA: Your journey has taken quite the detour, hasn't it?"NMany trainers would be jealous of this adventure. Foolhardy. All of them."$They don't know what they want."AMOM: Reunited once again! With our power no one can stop us!"FMOM: We'll make it through. Then we can be a family once again..."EMOM: You've become a great trainer. I couldn't be more proud...!"RFLORIN: Watch your step. There are a lot of rocks sticking out of the ground."2FLORIN: Bladestar will be nothing eventually."'GDC will be safe once and for all."?FLORIN: Grass types sure do make quick work of this place."FFLORIN: I wonder how much longer we have until we reach the exit?"FLORA: Don't trip."7FLORA: This is all such a bother. Don't you agree?"]FLORA: After all this we're going to have to report everything we've found to Cassandra."-Get ready for a 4 hour meeting with her."BFLORA: Why are we talking and not working to get out of here?")ERIN: Bladestar isn't a real threat."'They're just an annoying obstacle."?ERIN: You battle better than Aelita. That's for damn sure."=Maybe you should give her some lessons when we find her."1ERIN: Where did these people even come from?"2Perhaps there's a shortcut available to them."^ERIN: I tend to use more minimalistic Pokemon. What kind of Pokemon do you prefer to use?"OSHAWOTT: Oshaaa!!"&MELIA: Isn't this cave beautiful?"BI've been here before, but it takes my breath away each time."ZMELIA: Don't worry about your Pokemon. If they get hurt, I'll just take care of them."JMELIA: I wonder why my father wanted me to come here all of a sudden."EUsually he only sends me to local areas to complete my research."MMARIANETTE: This is the Courtyard... I haven't spent much time out here."EFather forbids me from being out here without his supervision..."oMARIANETTE: The flower garden here is one of my favorite places, but I'm not allowed out here too often..."<MARIANETTE: I never noticed how large this place was..."4I-I usually stick to my room and the library..."JMARIANETTE: This is the main living room. I hate this place the most."UIt's where Father resides for most part. The vibe in here just... It's too much."RMARIANETTE: Father sits on his white couch l-like it's a throne or something."I hate that couch!"XMARIANETTE: I never come down here... Except when it's dinner time and I have to..."GI-I wish there was a ladder that went directly to the dining room!"BMARIANETTE: I try to stay up on this floor whenever possible!"*Going downstairs is just too scary..."MMARIANETTE: I like jumping down the stairs even though it's dangerous..."Hehehe..."BMARIANETTE: \v[15], did you ever live in a huge house before?">MARIANETTE: Um, did you ever live in a huge house before?"9MARIANETTE: Uwah!! Really? You're just like me then!"4I think I would prefer a small house, though..."AIt takes so long just to go to one room... I want comfiness!"DMARIANETTE: Aw well... I think th-that's for the best, maybe..."DLarge houses suck... I-I mean, they stink! I don't cuss, sorry!"NMARIANETTE: This is the guest room... I dunno why we have a guest room..."HBut it's the room you were trapped in... So maybe you're our guest!"BMARIANETTE: I had to complete a sliding puzzle to free you..."8The completed image is s-so weird, don't you think?"8It looks like a girl, but it's not me... Who is it?"LMARIANETTE: I don't really like guests... They make me uncomfortable..."IBut you're different, \v[15]! You're the only guest I've ever liked!"FBut you're different, \PN! You're the only guest I've ever liked!"A\v[15]... Well, um... nevermind. Don't be mad at me, please."7Well, um... nevermind. Don't be mad at me, please."CMARIANETTE: I usually don't leave this floor unless I have to."CMy room is large and cozy. I don't need to leave... Sometimes."hMARIANETTE: Sometimes I like looking out the window and pretending I have a friend in this world..."FBut now I don't have to pretend because I have \v[15] at my side!"CBut now I don't have to pretend because I have you at my side!"DI guess we're not friends... But y-you're better than Father..."PMARIANETTE: Yawn... I'm getting tired... Maybe we should sleep for a bit..."BMARIANETTE: This is my favorite room in the mansion! My room!"EI have everything I need here! A bed, books, and um... a window?" That bed is really comfy..."JMARIANETTE: I have a diary in here. I talk about my days and stuff..."@It's not like I have a lot to do here. I'm usually alone..."8MARIANETTE: I like to play princess in the castle!!"[My Delcatty is my trusty guard... cat? Sometimes Father gives her this...\c[6]thing..."*It makes her far stronger than usual!"LMARIANETTE: This is the library. There are a lot of weird books here..."\There was one about a woman who could control ice and a woman who excelled with swords."They're lovely stories..."<MARIANETTE: C'mon \v[15]. We don't have time to read..."7MARIANETTE: C'mon... We don't have time to read..."We can read later!!"RMARIANETTE: The library is cool, but... Don't we have more important matters?"/If we don't hurry, your friends will be..."AMARIANETTE: Um... There's not much to say about this room..."It's empty."aMARIANETTE: \v[15], have your parents ever locked you out of a room and never explained why?"YMARIANETTE: Have your parents ever locked you out of a room and never explained why?"IMARIANETTE: Ugh, isn't it annoying?! I wanna know what's in there..."%I'm a big girl, I can handle it!"KMARIANETTE: Wow... You're lucky. But you're older so I can understand."EMARIANETTE: I've been outside the mansion from this side before.";Last time, there was a giant tree... But this time...?"7MARIANETTE: Is it time for dinner? I'm starving..."VYesterday I did something bad so Father said I couldn't eat for the entire day..."7I didn't even get to eat today... I'm so hungry..."#Give Marianette an Oran Berry?"MARIANETTE: ...!"I... I can have this?"%Th-Thank you, \v[15]! Thank you!"%Thanks so much, you're the best!"AMARIANETTE: That Oran Berry was so good! It was filling too."-Thanks so much, \v[15], you're the best!"DMARIANETTE: Last time I came out this way, it was a poolside...".I wonder what it's going to be this time?"MMARIANETTE: I want cake! I wanna throw it at someone and get in trouble!"AIs what a normal girl would say... right? I'm pretty sure..."6MARIANETTE: It's still raining? So troublesome..."*MARIANETTE: Um, what's that up there?"=MARIANETTE: I sense something around here... Be careful."6MARIANETTE: Uwahh... This maze is so confusing..."5Have you noticed that the red ivy leads the way?"BMARIANETTE: There are a ton of items scattered around here...".It may be useful to pick some of them up.",MARIANETTE: That Dusknoir was so scary."4I'm glad we were able to get away in one piece."PMARIANETTE: This room... It feels different. Are we even in the same world?"@MARIANETTE: Father hid one of your friends here, I know it."@MARIANETTE: This place... I don't really like how it feels."-\v[15], we shouldn't stay here too long."AMARIANETTE: I feel scared in here. This place is... ominous."BMARIANETTE: Is it just me, or does the air feel thin in here?"AI don't think there's much air down here at all, actually...".MARIANETTE: I hope your friends are okay."MMARIANETTE: Father can change the layout of this world to what he wants."$I don't know how, but he can..."]MARIANETTE: Last time I was here, there was a pool, but I doubt it'd be like that again."?MARIANETTE: \v[15], slow down! You're running too quickly!"7MARIANETTE: Slow down! You're running too quickly!"3MARIANETTE: We've arrived at the next trial..."KMARIANETTE: The end of the trial is right here, but it's closed off..."8There must be something we must do before it opens."1MARIANETTE: \v[15], we can do this together!".MARIANETTE: Hey, we can do this together!"9MARIANETTE: WH-WHAT? WHADDYA TALKIN' TO ME FOR? RUN!"?MARIANETTE: THAT DUSKNOIR IS GONNA CATCH US. RUN RUN RUN!!"MARIANETTE: RUN!!!"5MARIANETTE: Um... I don't really get this one..."4MARIANETTE: There's a sign on the wall, \v[15].",MARIANETTE: There's a sign on the wall."&Maybe that'll have a clue for us?"8MARIANETTE: I have a bad feeling about this room..."MARIANETTE: ..."MMARIANETTE: I finally get to see what's in this room! It's just storage!"..."3I thought it would be a secret forest realm..."2MARIANETTE: I wonder what's in these boxes..."Um, you want me to check?"*MARIANETTE: O-Okay! I'll take a look!")Marianette opened a box and found..."MARIANETTE: Wahhh!!!";MARIANETTE: S-So scary! But it was no trouble for you!"Z\ts[1]Marianette smacked the Bronzor with the broken shield and sealed the box again."HMARIANETTE: I-I would recommend not... Looking through these again."&MARIANETTE: Probably a good call."cMOSELY: I'd battle with you, but my Pangy is seriously tired from dealing with those bad guys."&Hopefully you'll last without it!"SMOSELY: This guy attacked Narcissa, right? Well, I don't really blame the guy."XNarcissa just has this really smug aspect about her. I mean, it's even in her name!"7Sometimes you just gotta give people a good whack!"jMOSELY: This place is so broken up and stuff. How'd all this stuff grow in here without any sunlight?"[Maybe I'll find a flower to bring back to Maman. She likes those kind of cheesy items."LBRAIXEN: I'll follow you and use the laser whenever you approach a box."Data recollection active."\Espu