Psst."4Were you the one who answered the Help Request?"Okay, okay."2They might be listening, so I can't say much-"'But they watch me everywhere I go."The shadows."-Please drive them away, I'm begging you."LIf I'm seeing them everywhere, you shouldn't have trouble finding them."Please..."Are they gone?"For real?"..."Oh, thank god.""You definitely deserve these."\PN received 12 AP!")I can finally stop watching my back-"Thanks a ton.[@@@	@
