prepared, once we get there, we won't be able to leave until the anomaly has been destroyed.",Zossie: Are you excited?! I'm excited!!"0The Xatu is holding a sign around its neck."C"Hello! This is the Xatu Taxi, sponsored by the Emera family!""e"I can take you between the parts of town on this island, but only if you've been there before!"" Where would you like to go?"YI heard there's an island nearby where Gossifleur can evolve into something weird..."Seems neat!"Percy: Hey \PN.",Something's odd about this whole thing."0I just can't put a finger on what, exactly."'Nothing like cycling on the beach!"3I can feel myself sinking in the sand already!"=It's only a matter of time before the beach consumes me!"It's locked."It's, so hot out.".I can feel my makeup melting off my face."Warren: \PN!"Knew you'd show up, bud."áThis church has been abandoned for a while, but it's the best lead we've got on the two that checked out those papers from the library."eI left you a help request in the PC, so go and accept that real quick and we'll break into here."bAlright, this church is supposed to be abandoned but there's nowhere else the notes could be."Let's head in."Warren: You ready?"Pup rowl!"Ruff! Ruff!"7Sorry, we have orders to keep anyone from passing."Listis: You again!"*I'm not taking any chances this time!"	Tch."Listis: Gah!"Just take it."\PN recieved a Cottonee!"BListis: Next time you cross me, I'll make sure you regret it!"+Percy: What do you mean we can't pass?"^Ranger: Sorry, our boss told us to keep people from accessing the docks until he returns.""Percy: And who might that be?"2Ranger: Someone way above your paygrade, kid."1Percy: Well, do you know when he'll be back?"yRanger: No clue. He's looking for a girl that went missing on a small island nearby a couple days ago, so who knows?"+Percy: One of the islands nearby, huh?":Thank you for your help, sorry for bothering you two."LRanger: You're good. It's not like we were doing anything else anyways."$Zossie: Awh, where could he be?"ePercy: I have somewhat of an idea. Those rangers helped us out more than they probably intended."Zossie: Really?"[Percy: Well, they mentioned their boss looking for a missing girl on an island nearby."yCoincidentally, that's where you two seem to be headed, as there's only one small island nearby, the Koneli Demesne."ôAlso, we can assume they started guarding the docks the moment their boss left, so if you two were planning to meet up today, it couldn't have been here."wI'm gonna guess you two were planning on leaving from a different part of the coast in this town, but on your own.";Zossie: Oh that makes sense! You're super duper smart!"@Do you know anything about the island we were checking out?"{Percy: Just that it's owned by some rich family, and no one's stepped foot on or off that island in a long, long time."%Zossie: Until now though, right?"/Percy: ...Yeah, it's odd to say the least."SAt any rate, I'm sure if we scour the beaches in town, we'll find your friend."+Zossie: Yay! Let's get searching then!"Percy: Excuse me-"Oh! \PN!"You ready to head off?"QThere's a ship that leaves from here to Auriga City every couple days or so."ZKara swung by just before you got here actually and said we should leave without her."!Wonder what's up with her...""Anyways, I hope you're ready."0It's a long, long boat ride to Auriga City.",Percy: Y'know, this is pretty exciting-"???: Wait!!!"Percy: Who..." ???: Hihi my name's Zossie!"Who are you guys?"Percy: ...Percy Oleander."And this is \PN."1Zossie: I love your names! Especially \PN's!")Percy: Um, what do you need from us?"TZossie: Oh right! I lost my companion in town, and I need help looking for him!">I'm, kinda new here so I don't even know where to look..."Percy: Hm...")I don't suppose we're in any rush..."#Percy: What do you think, \PN?"ZPercy: I feel like helping others out is kinda part of our job as assistants anyways."(Zossie: Ohmygosh thank you so much!"6Zossie: Wait, it shoul