 three keys now, but that isn't your issue."bYou need experience outside of trainer battles like these, battling in the field helps a lot."Kara: ..."/Kara: What am I supposed to do about that?"êEveryone and their mother gets to go on these fun and dangerous missions with \PN apparently, where they can get stronger together and whatever."RMeanwhile I'm just sitting here, doing whatever I can to not get left behind."$\PN's <i>my</i> friend, got it?"DIf anyone should be out in the field with them, it's <i>me</i>."Percy: Kara..."Kara: Go to hell, Perce."-Agrus: ...That was really hard to watch."&Percy: Should we... go after her?":Agrus: Nah, she's just takin' a loss a lil' too hard."Happens to the best of us."Percy: Still, I feel bad."AAgrus: As she gets stronger, she'll get better about losin'.")That aside, is the ship comin' soon?"%Percy: Should be any minute now."Agrus: That's fantastic."dI'm a nature guy myself, but after the whole thing at the Demesne, I'm ready to hit a big city."?Percy: Auriga City is the largest city in Zakos I believe."I'm looking forward to it."Agrus: You an' me both."ZAnd... we really need to learn about the plates before the Doctrine gets more of 'em."lPercy: There's a lot we don't know, and something tells me that we'll be seeing them more and more now."Agrus: Yer probably right.")Let's make sure we're ready for 'em."Let's dance!"Winding down..." Your party has been healed!"HEALING PARTY..."?The Calypsan Island is super scenic, I love shooting here."+Do you want to go back to the Demesne?"Let's set sail."I'll wait here for you."EAuriga City is easily twice the size of any other city in Zakos."$Percy: Don't sweat it too much."UThere's so much to do in Auriga City! I'm glad I used my vacation days for this."1Agrus: Nothin' like a good battle to unwind."YCanorra is a beautiful place, but sometimes it's nice to explore exotic locales, no?"@Agrus: The True Spooky Plate... what's so special about it?"Please be patient."No! I don'