lucky sometimes."No matter. I'll return.".You're not worth enough to hurt my pride."1Agrus: You got this. Show him how it's done."It's pointing northeast."Zossie: Um, hi guys!"Percy: [Zossie watch out-]"Must find..."Zossie: What was that for?"..."=Zossie: They don't seem like they're listening at all..."BPercy: [It's like they're in a daze... what's going on here?]"Rose? Rose?"Help..."Ag-rus...?"Must... Eat..."So, hungry..."Lost... Lost..."Where am I..."/Zossie: Any chance we could talk this out?"Fo...od..."Stomach..."DThe hail finally stopped, so we're in the middle of evacuating."Speciality"
Field"	Tips"CancelIu;␀9%[[©"It's pointing south."9Violet: I suppose congratulations are in order, \PN."3Agrus: Ah, well, I went easy on 'em a lil bit."Violet: A likely tale."`No time to celebrate however, we must get moving before the snowstorm thickens any further."6Agrus: Well, there is the Copperajah in the room."@What's keepin' us from gettin' dazed out there like my men?"VViolet: The hail is not the cause of the dazed state your colleagues were put in."gRather, the hail is merely form of delivery for a more... malevolent energy that devours the mind."=When inhaled in large quantities, the effects intensify."LAgrus: So that's why it ain't affectin' us out here, the snow is light."VIf yer right though, doesn't that mean that eventually it'll start dazin' us too?"<Violet: Correct, which is another reason we must hurry."[Agrus: Wait, so are you tellin' us to, not breathe, while explorin' the inner Demesne?"9I can hold my breath for a while, but not that long."àViolet: Nonsense. I pilfered these from the Manor before you found me, which was how I attracted the unwanted guests you two fought off."rAgrus: These're neat, but why would you grab 'em unless you hoped to take others with you in the first place?" Violet: Aha, you caught me."}I knew others had arrived here, and realized that there was no chance to stop Myron unless I guided them to the manor myself."JSo, I took a risk and stole these so we could have a fighting chance."SAgrus: ...I guess that makes sense. Looks like yer little plan worked out too."4I wonder what's takin' Zossie and Data so long.":They were supposed to meet us here before we set off."TViolet: Perhaps they got lost in the Inner Demesne, not an uncommon occurrence."$Agrus: I hope that's all it is."Let's get movin'."SAgrus: Next time we see each other, hopefully it's at the source of this mess."$Violet: Best of luck, lost one."XMy comrades already evacuated, but I decided to stay behind and help however I can."&Maybe I should become a ranger..."5That aside, maybe I can be of assistance to you?")Maybe I can be of assistance to you?"%Three blue shards, if you would."Just let me know!"Hestia: Oh, hey \PN."%You're challenging Agrus, right?"wAgrus gets really serious when he battles, which is bad for our schedule, so I can give you some tips if you want."jHestia: Agrus is a Bug-type specialist, which might seem like a weak type, but he'll prove you wrong."eHis ace is Beelzebub, his shiny Pinsir, which hits hard and becomes unstoppable very, very fast."•His signature move is Pincer Grip, a priority Bug-type attack that'll trap you in the field with his sweepers. It'll also raise his speed on the ice, so I'd be wary."xHestia: Well, the cave you two are battling in appears to be an Icy Field, since all the water in there froze over."fIt strengthens Ice-type moves, halves the damage of Fire-type moves, and freezes Rock-type moves."rThe ice is also super slippery, so Pokemon that use priority moves might skid on the ice and gain some speed."êHestia: Agrus fights in doubles and levels the playing field against his bugs by lowering the opponent's stats, usually Speed or Special Attack."WMaking sure your Pokemon aren't too slow by the time his sweepers come out is key."|The field also removes a lot of his weaknesses and gives him good coverage, which might make his mons hard to take out."mLuckily, there's a few ways to melt the field, although Fire-types still don't do too well on the water."wIf you can take down key threats fast and keep your Pokemon's stats in mind, you should be able to cinch this win."Good luck."Time to dance!"Not bad."Anytime!"Oh, a new face!"4Do you want to trade your Skitty for my Swablu?"No pressure."Let's do this then!""\PN traded Skitty for Swablu."Many thanks!"+Violet: Let us discuss our next steps."+???: What the fuck are you lookin' at?"..."+???: You're nowhere near my level yet."0Get a little stronger, and then we'll talk."4???: Ryou's gettin' us all together again, huh.",I guess I do miss bein' a Gym Leader..."@But I ain't headin' back just 'cause some chump told me to."iI'm Jolly, and if you want me to go back, you're gonna have to prove that you're worth listenin' to."(Jolly: Not that it matters, though-"3Because I'm about to wipe the ground with you."What the fuck...""Jolly: Yo, how'd you do that?"That was fuckin' insane!"`If these are the kinda challengers we'll be gettin', then I gotta get a whole lot stronger."Seeya."Hestia: Oh, \PN."4Were you the one who accepted the Help Request?""Hestia: So, here's the sitch."rWe've been trying to clear up some rocks in the inner Demesne, but a bunch of Tauros keep getting in our way."#Your job is to clear them out."Simple enough, right?"CAnd once you do, come back here and I'll give you your reward."You got this."Hestia: Nicely done."<We can go ahead and clear the rocks now, thanks to you."$As for your reward, how's this?"\PN received 12 AP!"Hestia: Thanks again, \PN."+Keep an eye on Agrus for me, will you?"(Zossie: There's more people here..."8Are they gonna be like the ones we fought just now?"???: Is someone out there?""Zossie: Yes! Can you help us?"e???: Oh, are you two with the other guy that arrived? He was in a weird spacesuit just like you."*Zossie: Yes! That's a friend of ours!"1Also, um, what's up with the people outside?"*???: Right, I guess I should explain."2The name's Hestia by the way, who're you two?")Zossie: I'm Zossie! And this is \PN!"DHestia: So, I'm sure you two have noticed the hail here, right?".Well, that shouldn't be possible. At all."iThe Koneli Demesne is just off the coast of the Calypsan Island, which is definitely in the tropics."(Zossie: Yeah that is kinda weird..."9What's that have to do with the dazey people though?"QHestia: Well, in the outer Demesne, the hail falls lightly so it's no issue."pBut further in, the hail is much stronger, and those that tried to brave it, well, they ended up like that."7Zossie: But hail's not supposed to do that, right?"
Hm..."1I guess we have a mystery on our hands, \PN!"iHestia: We took your friend to meet with our captain, Agrus. He should be in the tent north of here."%Zossie: Let's go find Data then!"Agrus: Ah, yer here."(\PN, meet Hyacinth, Rose's brother."2We already told 'im everythin' that happened.">Hyacinth: So this is the infamous \PN Miss Olga spoke of."EI am Hyacinth Amphitrite, Templar of Temperance and a keyholder.">Agrus: Outta curiosity, what are ya the Templar of, Rose?"Rose: Diligence."eHyacinth: We'll see if your position isn't in jeopardy after the stunt you pulled, following me."PYou're lucky you managed to find allies who could get you out of this mess."0Rose: ...I helped too. It wasn't just them."KHyacinth: And \PN, I was told you five teamed up with the Sin of Envy."RI can understand desperate times, in your situation I may have done the same."XBut I trust that you'll leave your little alliance a temporary one, you understand?"@I am far less forgiving than Rose for consorting with rats.";I am glad you kept your contact with her to a minimum."$Agrus: Lay off of 'em Hyacinth."'Not everyone's as... devout as ya."7Hyacinth: I gave up on you a long time ago, Agrus."<But I may as well set this youngster on the right path.""Zossie: ...This is awkward..."àData: Ahem, at any rate, the special guests we have are in your tent, Agrus. They requested the presence of you, Hyacinth, and \PN here."6Agrus: Why're ya keepin' 'em a secret by the way?"Zossie: They asked us to!"=Hyacinth: Well, let's go meet these special guests then.")Find a good spot for a battle, Rose."+I have a request to make of \PN later."4Data: Ah, we should take our leave now, Zossie."MWe've been off the grid for too long, and the anomaly has been resolved."EZossie: Awww, I wanted to spend more time with my new friends..."?Data: Unfortunately, this is the nature of the work we do."fAlthough, given what I saw today, I think our work may take us back to this region in the future."sAgrus: Then I hope to see ya two again. Well, not that I want there to be any issues, but ya know what I mean.")Zossie: Oh! I'll give you this, too-"*Agrus obtained the True Spooky Plate!"!Agrus: Ah right, this thing."QI have someone I wanna ask about this, there's still too much we don't know."2Hyacinth: I'll trust you with it then, Agrus."GData: You may get your wish since the True Spooky Plate was taken."AIt would not surprise me if it caused trouble in the future."4Hyacinth: The cult heretic took it, didn't she?"4I will talk to Miss Olga and see what she says."-We will need to recover it at all costs."2Rose: ...I can't believe I couldn't stop her.""I won't let her go next time."EData: At any rate, farewell. It was a pleasure working together."BZossie: Let's work together another time! I'll miss you guys!"<Agrus: See y'all around, and thanks for helpin' us out."'Rose: Thank you two, and farewell.""Hyacinth: Interesting people."3Agrus: We couldn't have done this without 'em."Let's head to my tent."Yes"No"Dual Chop"	None"Speciality"
