"|Ryou: Also, with the King's position at the mercy of the Pantheon, the keyholders are asked to scatter and stay hidden-"RAurora: Which makes them a MASSIVE pain for the average trainer to challenge."=Ryou: As two aspiring trainers, we got fed up with this."[We decided to start the very first Zakos Pokemon League, and gathered nineteen others-"FAurora: Friends, colleagues, and strong trainers that we knew of-"ORyou: So they could be the Gym Leaders and Champion of our Pokemon League."]Aurora: But then, just as we were about to start opening up challenges, disaster struck."KOne of our leaders, Lori, got publicly arrested by the ranger-knights."FRyou: It sent a pretty clear message, the King wanted us to stop."0So, we did what we had to do and scattered."OAurora: And Ryou and I decided to set up shop here and haven't left since."But, the plan."Ryou: The plan."cWe haven't given up on our dream of starting the Zakos League, and now we have an opportunity."bKing Joseph has shut the gates of Mt. Olympa and has declared the royal house to be isolated."≤Aurora: Which is a perfect opportunity to get the League rolling again, and hopefully have it established by the time the gates open again so the King can't do anything about it.")Ryou: That's where you come in, \PN."VWe've tried contacting the others, but they either brush us off or don't respond."vAurora: We think that if they saw an actual trainer interested in the league, they might be interested again too!"VPretty simple right? Find the nineteen leaders, and convince them to gather here!"-Ryou: Unfortunately, it's not that easy."3When I said we scattered, we <i>scattered</i>."ZI don't know where more than half of them are now, so finding them will be difficult."tAurora: They'll also be hard to convince with just words, but if you can beat them in battle, that might do it."õRyou: We haven't just been twiddling our thumbs waiting for a strong trainer to come by though, let me show you what we've been doing here all these years."*Meet us in the big building up ahead!""Aurora: It's pretty exciting~[7@@@	@
