h openly is very freeing."#Xevon: Welcome to Koneli City."3At least, what it looked like a long time ago.">The Doctrine made their home here, hoping to live freely."(I sent ten poppets around the city."?Find them. Talk to as many people as you can while you do.""Maybe then you'll understand."/Xevon: I sent ten poppets around the city."Xevon: Do you get it now?" Look how happy everyone is."èAfter years of living in squalor, oppressed by the Church and the Royal House, they had finally found comfort in the arms of the Koneli Family."jThey tasted happiness for a moment, only to have it taken away once more once the Koneli Family fell."2We just want our people to be free once more."You understand, don't you?"..."DXevon: But you continue to insist on being a thorn in our side." If that's how it has to be-".To think we lived in such squalor before."CGone are the days of having to speak to my associates in code!"Fletch."JHaving tasted comfort, I don't think I could give it up for anything."ZMuch like how the High Architect threw out His Shadow, we were scorned by the Church."5We have found camarederie amongst ourselves now."Fletch~"What a nice day it is..." I couldn't be happier here."Fletch!"PMy parents were always arguing before, but now they're happy, and I am too!"Ah ha ha!"I'm having so much fun!"LI had to work before so we could eat, but now I have so much free time![*@@@	@
