;[	"FTee hee! That's where you need to go, but you can't go there yet~"VMyron has ordered the three of us to waste your time while he makes preparations."&So let's play some hide and seek~"5There is a strong force keeping the door closed.Iu;␀[[}"Totodile looks hungry.".Do you want to give it the Gourmet Treat?"#It doesn't seem to notice you."+Envy: We're so close. You can feel it.":Rose: It's a horrible chilly feeling in my stomach..."OEnvy: I guess now's the best time to talk about what we're expecting here.")Rose: Myron's waiting for us, right?"ZGiven that he seems to want us to find him, I doubt there'll be much else in our way."3Agrus: He has to have somethin' planned right?"*Why would he lead us straight to him?""Envy: Myron used to be Pride."rIt's possible that he just thinks he can beat the four of us, and all of this is just him... playing with us.":Rose: Then we just have to prove him wrong, don't we?"OWe're all strong trainers. If we work together, he doesn't stand a chance."..."<Rose: ...What, why are you all looking at me like that?"1Agrus: It's nothin'. Yer right, we got this."4Envy: I just didn't expect a pep talk from you."(You called me strong, I'm blushing~"9Rose: I'm not going to dignify that with a response."5Agrus: Do we wanna come up with some kinda plan?"nEnvy: How about this, you three walk up to him, and I'll try and sneak in from behind and grab the plate."2Rose: Simple enough. What if it doesn't work?";Agrus: Then we beat Myron's ass and grab it ourselves."Rose: Solid."7Agrus: Let's go put the old man back in his grave."???: What just happened..."I'm back?"*Was this your doing, Temple Guardian?"2Myron: If this means what I think it means..."6The Mirror has given us a second chance it seems."Haha..."Hahaha..."HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"NOTHING CAN STOP ME NOW!"Myron: Ah! You made it!"1Agrus: We're here for the True Spooky Plate."!Rose: Hand it over, ingrate!"BMyron: Was that your grand plan? To simply demand it from me?" Ah, but you're missing one-"1Myron: Did you really think that would work?"-Envy: ...Shit. Time for the backup plan."-Myron: A backup plan? Now we're talking!"(What could it be, what could it be-"FAgrus: Simple. The four of us just beat the livin' hell outta ya."BMyron: The reliable brute force method, I like your thinking!"7Unfortunately, you made a rather hasty assumption."Envy: Huh...?"+Myron: I never said I'd be here alone.")Agrus: ...Violet? What are ya doin'?"7Violet: I can't stop myself. I'm sorry Agrus, \PN."LMyron: Ah, theatrics, betrayal. This was more fun than I had hoped for!"}I initially wanted to just torment the sweet little churchgoer and her allies, but I've outdone myself this time, truly."*Agrus: Gah, let's jus' split this up-"aRose, we're takin' care of Violet and the maids, \PN and Envy, you better not lose to Myron!"!Envy: Who do you think I am?"LMyron: How exciting! What wonderful specimens you all turned out to be!";Alas, every experiment must eventually come to an end."KI apologize, but I cannot allow progress to suffer the same fate as I.";How...? You're just lab rats, insects beneath my feet-"+Myron: This wasn't supposed to happen-"IEnvy: What was it like? Being beaten by "insects beneath your feet"?"Agrus: Ya did it!"Rose: It's over Myron-"@Violet: You did it. Thank you \PN, Agrus. I can rest again."Myron: Nonsense, nonsense!".This is a mere setback, a miscalculation-"]The True Spooky Plate is almost ready, even without its guardian I should still prevail!"Zossie: This thing?"%Data: The source of the anomaly."!Myron: Wait! Don't touch it!"LI'll give you all unlimited power in my new world, isn't that enticing?"SIsn't that what you small people always want? More power? Glory? Fame? Wealth?"$You can have it all, I promise-" Myron: What are you doing?!"3You could have had it all you ungrateful girl!"I could have had it all..."5Zossie: Wow, this thing is surprisingly heavy..."-Agrus: Finally, we can get outta here..."Rose: Wait, my brother!"(Data: 