s! I got some information that's way more useful to us."(I have to thank you though, really."@Nevertheless, I'm sure we'll see each other around. Byebye!"&Agrus: What is she talkin' about?"3Dammit, couldn't even ask her any questions..."\As for this information... let us hope it doesn't cause too many problems in her hands."Yes"No[}@@@	@
