p, which will explode if hit by a physical move."SThe user regains up to half of its max HP. It restores more HP in a sandstorm."KThe user stabs the target with a sharp horn. This attack never misses."XA two-turn attack. The user gathers light into a blade, attacking on the next turn."KThe user bursts into song, emitting many bubbles which can heal burns."^The user hides in the target's shadow, steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks."4The user exchanges Speed stats with the target."]The user shines a spotlight on the target so that only they will be attacked this turn. "^Driven by frustration, the user attacks, doubling in power if their previous move failed."YRestores the user's HP by the same amount as the target's Attack stat and lowers it."UThe user slams into the target with the force of a meteor, ignoring its ability."HThe user gets teary eyed, lowering the target's Attack and Sp. Atk."VThe user attacks the target's throat, preventing sound-based moves for two turns."WThe user shoots poisonous threads to poison the target and lower their Speed stat."]The user lands an intense kick of tropical origins on the target, lowering their Attack."_A strong electric blast crashes down on the target. This may also make the target flinch. "cThe user slams into the target, cloaked in energy. The memory held determines the move's type."TTwo turns after this move is used, a hunk of psychic energy attacks the target."gTwo turns after this move is used, the user blasts the target with a concentrated bundle of light."uThe user lobs a ball of fire at the target formed from psychic energy. It may also leave the target with a burn."[The user attacks while stitching the target's shadow to the ground, preventing escape.">A shining wing strikes the target, removing stat changes."lThe user attacks a target with a pillar of light. Uses the higher of either Attack or Sp. Attack stats."eThe user attacks everything around it by causing its own head to explode. Also damages the user."^The user attacks with electrically charged fists. Normal-type moves become Electric-type."␀"UA rock clumped with gems is fired at the target, targetting its special defense."LPuts up a wall of sand that reduces the power of super-effective moves."_Applies a sinister mark on the target, damaging over time and changing its type to Ground."QThe target is attacked with hella small flames. It may also burn the target."äThe user rotates, centering the hex nut in its chest, and then strikes with its arms twice in a row. This may also make the target flinch."WThis relentless attack does massive damage to targets affected by status problems."qThe user unleashes a strong beam from its core. This move deals twice the damage if the target is Dynamaxed."àThe user ignores the effects of opposing Pok√©mon's moves and Abilities that draw in moves, allowing this move to hit the chosen target."õThis move prevents the user and the target from switching out until either of them faints. The effect goes away if either of the Pok√©mon leaves the field."HThe user eats its held Berry, then sharply raises its Defense stat."_This move raises all the user's stats but prevents the user from switching out or fleeing."The user pours sticky tar over the target, lowering the target's Speed stat. The target becomes weaker to Fire-type moves."WThe user scatters a cloud of magic powder that changes the target to Psychic type."dThe user attacks twice using Dreepy. If there are two targets, this move hits each target once."aThe user has teatime with all the Pok√©mon in the battle. Each Pok√©mon eats its held Berry."}The user locks the target in and prevents it from fleeing. This move also lowers the target's Defense and Sp. Def every turn."~The user stabs the target with its electrified beak. If the user attacks before the target, the power of this move is doubled."␀"}The user rends the target with its hard gills. If the user attacks before the target, the power of this move is doubled."WWith its mysterious power, the user swaps the effects on either side of the field.";The user raises all its stats by using some of its HP."ÉThe user attacks by slamming its body into the target. The higher the user's Defense, the more damage it can inflict on the target."\The user sharply raises the target's Attack and Sp. Atk stats by decorating the target."zThe user plays its drum, controlling the drum's roots to attack the target. This also lowers the target's Speed stat."FThe user snares the target in a snap trap for four to five turns."ÜThe user attacks by igniting a small stone and launching it as a fiery ball at the target. This may also leave the target with a burn."xThe user becomes a gigantic sword and cuts the target. This move deals twice the damage if the target is Dynamaxed."yThe user becomes a gigantic shield and cuts the target. This move deals twice the damage if the target is Dynamaxed."ÅMorpeko attacks and raises its Speed with the energy stored in its cheeks. This move's type changes depending on the user's form."nThe user swings its tough tail wildly and attacks opposing Pok√©mon. This also lowers their Attack stats."LThe user attacks the target by poking it with a sharply pointed branch."vThe user attacks opposing Pok√©mon by twanging a guitar or bass guitar, causing a huge echo and strong vibration."|The user attacks the target with an acidic liquid created from tart apples. This also lowers the target's Sp. Def stat."|The user attacks the target with an acidic liquid created from tart apples. This also lowers the target's Defense stat."ÉThe user attacks the target with so much force that it could break the target's spirit. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk stat."UThe user attacks the target by emitting steam. This may also confuse the target."qThe user scatters mysterious water around and restores the HP of itself and its ally Pok√©mon in the battle."cProtects the user from all attacks. Direct contact harshly lowers the attacker's Defense stat."xThe user pretends to bow its head, but then it stabs the target with its disheveled hair. This attack never misses."ÉThe user attacks wildly with its thick leek. The user can't move on the next turn, because the force of this move makes it stagger."iThis is Eternatus's most powerful attack in its original form. The user can't move on the next turn."gThe user fires a beam of steel that it collected from its entire body. This also damages the user."UA relentless attack using cursed tendrils. Drains HP and has a chance to poison."MPlease don't hack it in, it's a bad move on its own, don't be weirdchamp"hThe user attacks the opponent, controlling knocked out ally Pok√©mon with strings for extra damage."8The Pok√©mon congratulates you on your special day!"NUsing Happy Hour doubles the amount of prize money received after battle!"AThe user and an ally hold hands. This makes them very happy."%Melia's signature move. Stage 1."%Melia's signature move. Stage 2."%Melia's signature move. Stage 3."hThe user throws scorching sand at the target to attack. This may also leave the target with a burn."QTThe user slams the target with its wings. The target is hit twice in a row.["␀"
