ing screech harshly lowers the target's Defense stat."iThe user attacks everything around it by causing an explosion. The user faints upon using this move."UThe user frightens the target with a scary face to harshly lower its Speed stat."wThe user gazes at the target rather charmingly, making it less wary. This harshly lowers the target's Attack stat."VThe user traps the target in a violent swirling whirlpool for four to five turns."wThe user gets all party Pok√©mon to attack the target. The more party Pok√©mon, the greater the number of attacks."HThis attack move varies in power and type depending on the weather."UThe user feigns crying to fluster the target, harshly lowering its Sp. Def stat."XThe user traps the target inside a harshly raging sandstorm for four to five turns."OThe user forcefully shoots seeds at the target two to five times in a row."MThe user launches sharp icicles at the target two to five times in a row"gThe user attacks by hurling a blob of mud at the target. This also lowers the target's Speed stat."VThe user hurls hard rocks at the target. Two to five rocks are launched in a row."TIf the target's HP is half or less, this attack will hit with double the power."aIf the target has already taken some damage in the same turn, this attack's power is doubled"jThe user employs its psychic power to switch changes to its Attack and Sp. Atk stats with the target."kThe user employs its psychic power to switch changes to its Defense and Sp. Def stats with the target."[The user employs its psychic power to switch changes to its Speed stat with the target"eThe user bites with cold-infused fangs. This may also make the target flinch or leave it frozen."kThe user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. This may also make the target flinch or leave it with a burn."lThe user bites with electrified fangs. This may also make the target flinch or leave it with paralysis."fThe user tears at the target with blades formed by psychic power. Critical hits land more easily."nA