<ar>{1}</ar>"0{1}'s Sunny Day intensified the sun's rays!"#{1}'s Rain Dance made it rain!",{1}'s Sandstorm whipped up a sandstorm!"{1}'s Hail made it hail!"#{1}'s {2} boosted its Evasion!"'{1}'s ability boosted its Evasion!"${1}'s item boosted its Evasion!"{1}'s evasion fell!"The mist was corroded!"*The dark crystals were became molten!"2The battle broke through to the mountain top!"$The wind snuffed out the flame!"(The blizzard snuffed out the flame!"2The battle broke through to the volcanic top!"%The polluted field was purified!"'Dug into the heart of the volcano!"&The battle was pulled underwater!"%Poison spread through the water!"The battle resurfaced!")The cave was littered with crystals!" The flame ignited the cave!"4The crystal's light was warped by the darkness!" The crystals became molten!"*The malestrom flushed out the poison!"(Dug into the heart of the mountain!"/Dug into the frozen heart of the mountain!"#The garden was cut down a bit!" The dimension was purified!"(The dimension cleared was purified!"%The cave's corruption combusted!"%{1} broke through the confusion!",The psychic aura consumed the darkness!"It's a Sonic Rainboom!"%{1} inverted {2}'s stat changes!"The terrain was inverted!"&Beginner's luck quickly runs out."'I'm warning you, stay out of this."Whatever it takes."%Am I pushed this far up already?"3Who the hell said you could push me like this?""Invigorated yet? I know I am!"5Two badges don't mean nothin'! I'm not done yet!"IWow... Wow! You're still pushing me to my limits?! I'm so impressed!"4Huff n' puff! I'm not done yet! Check this out!"<Your stance is all over the place! Move more like this!"BI won't stop until the very end. You get no sympathy from me."XThis is what it feels like to be at the end? I can almost see her beautiful face..."=Wait... I don't think this is how it was supposed to go."8You can't be serious? I've only begun your torture!"MYou think you've won because I'm on my last leg? You're a fuckin' idiot."NI have the